1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,100
<i>Jin Ho, I cannot blame you
if you are angry with us.</i>

2
00:00:02,233 --> 00:00:05,033
<i>At long last,
we finally meet, woman.</i>

3
00:00:05,167 --> 00:00:06,800
<i>You are only brave
because you have a gun.</i>

4
00:00:06,933 --> 00:00:08,000
<i> I have an idea.</i>

5
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:09,667
<i> Do the honors, Jin Ho.</i>

6
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,000
<i>This is your last chance
to prove your loyalty.</i>

7
00:00:12,133 --> 00:00:14,367
<i>Why did you shoot Liza
instead of me?</i>

8
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,067
<i>I do not even know
if I made the right choice.</i>

9
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,533
<i>- You said...
- [LIZA GROANING]</i>

10
00:00:17,667 --> 00:00:20,200
<i> Jin Ho will not betray us.</i>

11
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:22,200
<i> Major, I went to Joey.</i>

12
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:23,233
<i> Jin Ho took her.</i>

13
00:00:23,367 --> 00:00:25,533
<i>They need to know
that I am safe.</i>

14
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:26,600
<i> I have a way.</i>

15
00:00:26,733 --> 00:00:27,733
<i> Joey, my child, where are you?</i>

16
00:00:27,867 --> 00:00:28,700
<i> I will not stop</i>

17
00:00:28,833 --> 00:00:31,000
<i> until I find Joey.</i>

18
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:36,133
<i> [OPENING THEME MUSIC]</i>

19
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,433
[CAR CHIMES]

20
00:00:55,067 --> 00:00:56,433
Hey!

21
00:01:01,533 --> 00:01:03,033
Why?

22
00:01:03,533 --> 00:01:05,033
Do not come back, okay?

23
00:01:07,167 --> 00:01:08,400
Wait.

24
00:01:08,533 --> 00:01:10,600
Why are you angry at me?
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

25
00:01:11,467 --> 00:01:13,833
Jin Ho is the one
putting Joey in danger, not me.

26
00:01:13,967 --> 00:01:15,400
What Jin Ho?

27
00:01:15,533 --> 00:01:17,533
Jin Ho will not hurt Joey.

28
00:01:17,667 --> 00:01:19,200
He is not like you!

29
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,567
What?

30
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:24,400
You forget so easily.

31
00:01:25,367 --> 00:01:27,667
Did you not reject Joey?

32
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,367
What? She is just not around,

33
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:31,133
and now suddenly you care?

34
00:01:32,733 --> 00:01:34,700
You have some nerve!

35
00:01:35,433 --> 00:01:37,700
Did you not see how kind she is,

36
00:01:38,267 --> 00:01:39,633
how brave she is,

37
00:01:39,767 --> 00:01:41,467
how beautiful she is?

38
00:01:41,633 --> 00:01:43,367
What are you? Blind?

39
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:44,933
Heartless?

40
00:01:46,433 --> 00:01:49,267
You are lucky
you were the one she chose.

41
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,000
She loved you,

42
00:01:51,133 --> 00:01:52,833
and you only hurt her.

43
00:01:56,033 --> 00:01:57,200
So...

44
00:01:57,333 --> 00:01:59,067
this is your real issue?

45
00:01:59,833 --> 00:02:00,567
That I was chosen, not you?

46
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:02,700
Yes!

47
00:02:02,833 --> 00:02:05,100
Because if it were me,
I would never make her cry!

48
00:02:05,233 --> 00:02:06,533
I would never hurt her!

49
00:02:07,533 --> 00:02:10,300
I would give her the treatment
she deserves!

50
00:02:10,433 --> 00:02:11,933
I would love her!

51
00:02:14,233 --> 00:02:15,533
Okay.

52
00:02:17,133 --> 00:02:17,900
Wait, but...

53
00:02:18,033 --> 00:02:20,200
do you not think
this is pointless?

54
00:02:20,333 --> 00:02:21,467
Because while we are arguing,

55
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,867
while you treat me this way,

56
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,000
she is with another man.

57
00:02:27,033 --> 00:02:28,333
What are you talking about?

58
00:02:28,467 --> 00:02:30,267
You said yourself

59
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:33,167
Jin Ho would not hurt Joey,

60
00:02:34,133 --> 00:02:36,067
but he might do something else.

61
00:02:39,033 --> 00:02:40,567
Do not forget.

62
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:43,167
Jin Ho has feelings for Joey.

63
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:46,333
<i> Now I get it.</i>

64
00:02:46,467 --> 00:02:49,667
<i>I understand why you
like Joey so much.</i>

65
00:02:49,833 --> 00:02:50,867
<i>- What?
- Look at her.</i>

66
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:55,067
<i>She is very pretty, very nice,
very sincere.</i>

67
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,100
<i>You know,
when she smiles at you,</i>

68
00:02:57,233 --> 00:02:59,367
<i> you cannot say no to her.</i>

69
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:02,633
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

70
00:03:15,033 --> 00:03:19,067
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC PLAYING]

71
00:03:24,767 --> 00:03:26,433
[SIGHS]

72
00:03:28,667 --> 00:03:29,933
I cannot sleep.

73
00:03:30,067 --> 00:03:33,367
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

74
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,867
I am sorry.

75
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:45,100
I did not expect...

76
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,533
my day to end like this.

77
00:03:49,967 --> 00:03:52,167
I thought...

78
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:54,533
the syndicates
would finally be arrested,

79
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:58,133
and that all of this would
finally be over,

80
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:01,967
and I would be
with my mother and father.

81
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,700
But here I am now...

82
00:04:07,367 --> 00:04:08,900
hiding.

83
00:04:12,833 --> 00:04:15,800
You have every right
to be upset with me.

84
00:04:16,567 --> 00:04:18,433
But remember this...

85
00:04:19,633 --> 00:04:21,433
I never wanted
to hurt you either.

86
00:04:23,867 --> 00:04:26,933
I also told my father
not to hurt you.

87
00:04:30,033 --> 00:04:31,933
That was the only thing...

88
00:04:32,067 --> 00:04:34,600
I could ask from him...

89
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,200
for you.

90
00:04:38,567 --> 00:04:40,933
I hope you understand, Jin Ho.

91
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,367
Go to sleep.

92
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:49,567
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

93
00:05:03,967 --> 00:05:05,567
Oh, good evening, Sir.

94
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:06,967
Good evening.

95
00:05:09,033 --> 00:05:10,167
Andrew...

96
00:05:12,033 --> 00:05:13,133
Are you okay?

97
00:05:13,267 --> 00:05:15,033
Nanny, can you get him
some water, please?

98
00:05:15,167 --> 00:05:16,700
Excuse me.

99
00:05:16,833 --> 00:05:18,967
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

100
00:05:19,100 --> 00:05:21,700
Sis, can I stay here tonight?

101
00:05:22,700 --> 00:05:24,433
You look exhausted.

102
00:05:24,567 --> 00:05:26,167
Where did you come from?

103
00:05:27,033 --> 00:05:29,400
I came from a drug raid.

104
00:05:29,533 --> 00:05:30,533
What?

105
00:05:30,667 --> 00:05:32,300
A drug raid?

106
00:05:33,633 --> 00:05:37,100
You might be forgetting that
you are not a police officer.

107
00:05:37,267 --> 00:05:39,400
You are a journalist!

108
00:05:39,533 --> 00:05:43,267
But you keep putting yourself
in danger.

109
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,000
Sis, I am okay.

110
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:50,267
But I do not know
how Joey is right now.

111
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:52,767
Why? What happened to Joey?

112
00:05:52,900 --> 00:05:54,367
We got caught in the chaos,

113
00:05:54,933 --> 00:05:57,367
and then the Korean syndicate
took her.

114
00:05:58,267 --> 00:05:59,700
Oh my gosh!

115
00:05:59,833 --> 00:06:01,900
Poor Clarissa.

116
00:06:02,733 --> 00:06:06,067
Sis, this syndicate has been
looking for Joey for a long time

117
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,633
because she has video evidence

118
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,367
of them beating Ramon Orbos.

119
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:12,700
And what are the police doing?

120
00:06:12,833 --> 00:06:15,267
They are tracking
the Korean man,

121
00:06:16,067 --> 00:06:17,933
but they do not have
a solid lead yet.

122
00:06:18,067 --> 00:06:22,300
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

123
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:27,033
Have some water, please.

124
00:06:27,167 --> 00:06:30,567
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

125
00:06:34,133 --> 00:06:38,200
[PHONE RINGING]
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

126
00:06:39,967 --> 00:06:41,133
Berdugo.

127
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:43,533
Find Jin Ho as fast as you can.

128
00:06:43,667 --> 00:06:46,500
Because the woman with him,
Joey Delgado,

129
00:06:46,633 --> 00:06:48,600
is Miguel Delgado's daughter.

130
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,700
That explains why
she looked familiar.

131
00:06:51,833 --> 00:06:53,167
But it was too dark,

132
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:55,467
so I could not see
her face clearly.

133
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:57,700
<i> Just fix this.</i>

134
00:06:58,233 --> 00:07:00,700
<i>The police are already moving
to find them.</i>

135
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:03,533
We need to get to them first

136
00:07:03,667 --> 00:07:06,667
because Jin Ho
will definitely give us up.

137
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,867
Remember, he saw me.

138
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,100
I will handle it, Berdugo.

139
00:07:11,233 --> 00:07:14,367
Make sure you do not mess this
up again, Liza.

140
00:07:14,533 --> 00:07:16,233
Yes, Berdugo.

141
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,867
Let's go!

142
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:26,100
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

143
00:07:29,633 --> 00:07:31,333
<i> I am sorry, brother-in-law.</i>

144
00:07:31,467 --> 00:07:33,300
<i> Instead of saving them,</i>

145
00:07:33,433 --> 00:07:35,433
<i>it looks like you put them
in more danger.</i>

146
00:07:35,567 --> 00:07:39,467
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

147
00:07:41,500 --> 00:07:46,167
[ROOSTER CROWING]

148
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,067
Jin Ho?

149
00:08:00,733 --> 00:08:02,333
Jin Ho?

150
00:08:07,767 --> 00:08:09,300
Jin Ho?!

151
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:12,067
Jin Ho!

152
00:08:12,667 --> 00:08:14,100
Ah...

153
00:08:14,233 --> 00:08:15,767
Jin Ho...

154
00:08:16,367 --> 00:08:20,367
[SMOOTH ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

155
00:08:35,467 --> 00:08:40,333
[SMOOTH ROMANTIC MUSIC
CONTINUES]

156
00:08:42,467 --> 00:08:43,633
Ah...

157
00:08:43,767 --> 00:08:46,567
There is water in the sink,
right?

158
00:08:46,700 --> 00:08:48,133
Yes, there is water,

159
00:08:48,267 --> 00:08:49,933
but did you see the pressure?

160
00:08:50,067 --> 00:08:52,467
You cannot even wash your hands.

161
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,333
This is for bathing.

162
00:08:55,433 --> 00:08:56,733
Oh, for bathing.

163
00:08:56,867 --> 00:08:58,867
Yes, thank you.

164
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:03,067
[SMOOTH ROMANTIC MUSIC
CONTINUES]

165
00:09:15,667 --> 00:09:17,200
You are grumpy.

166
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:20,433
[CLACKS]

167
00:09:20,567 --> 00:09:24,500
[LIGHT PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

168
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:40,067
[PLEASANT MUSIC PLAYING]

169
00:09:45,900 --> 00:09:47,333
Oh, Andrew...

170
00:09:48,567 --> 00:09:50,467
It looks like you did not sleep.

171
00:09:52,633 --> 00:09:54,700
Yeah, I was waiting for
Joey's...

172
00:09:54,833 --> 00:09:57,133
Joey's updates, to see
how she is doing.

173
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,733
I was right.

174
00:10:02,933 --> 00:10:06,933
You care about her a lot
more than you care to admit.

175
00:10:11,567 --> 00:10:12,900
Yes.

176
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:16,200
I feel like it might
already be too late, Sis.

177
00:10:17,467 --> 00:10:19,400
She is really angry with me.

178
00:10:19,533 --> 00:10:21,767
[DREAMY MUSIC PLAYING]

179
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:23,167
I...

180
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,833
I rejected her.

181
00:10:28,167 --> 00:10:30,600
I thought I was doing
the right thing,

182
00:10:30,733 --> 00:10:32,367
the mature thing...

183
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:34,100
for both of us.

184
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:37,233
But now, it feels like
I was wrong.

185
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:40,800
I just want
to make things right with her,

186
00:10:42,033 --> 00:10:44,300
but I feel like it is too late.

187
00:10:44,433 --> 00:10:46,200
Well...

188
00:10:46,333 --> 00:10:49,667
you cannot control
how angry she is right now,

189
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:51,167
but...

190
00:10:51,300 --> 00:10:55,633
you can control
whether you fight for her.

191
00:10:55,767 --> 00:10:58,867
[DREAMY MUSIC CONTINUES]

192
00:11:10,933 --> 00:11:12,467
There.

193
00:11:18,633 --> 00:11:21,733
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

194
00:11:21,867 --> 00:11:23,067
Joey!

195
00:11:24,133 --> 00:11:25,433
Oh?

196
00:11:25,567 --> 00:11:26,733
What?

197
00:11:26,867 --> 00:11:28,500
Where is the water?

198
00:11:28,633 --> 00:11:30,133
I used it, why?

199
00:11:30,267 --> 00:11:31,800
You used all of it?

200
00:11:31,933 --> 00:11:33,933
Yes, that was for me, right?

201
00:11:35,033 --> 00:11:36,700
[SPEAKS IN KOREAN]

202
00:11:36,833 --> 00:11:38,633
Unbelievable.

203
00:11:38,767 --> 00:11:40,567
That was for both of us.

204
00:11:40,700 --> 00:11:42,533
You should not use all of it.

205
00:11:42,700 --> 00:11:44,467
Oh, sorry.

206
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,933
I did not know.

207
00:11:46,067 --> 00:11:48,467
I was already feeling
really sticky earlier.

208
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,200
I will just get you some water.

209
00:11:50,333 --> 00:11:52,067
No, no, no, no! You cannot.
[PLEASANT MUSIC PLAYING]

210
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:54,267
There is a schedule
for the water here.

211
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:56,333
And it already stoped!

212
00:11:56,467 --> 00:11:58,667
It will not come back
until tomorrow.

213
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:00,967
Oh, sorry.

214
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:02,700
I really did not know.

215
00:12:02,833 --> 00:12:04,233
[SIGHING]

216
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,867
Hey, where are you going?

217
00:12:09,567 --> 00:12:11,767
Somewhere that actually
has water.

218
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,433
Ah...

219
00:12:16,267 --> 00:12:17,600
Oh...

220
00:12:18,533 --> 00:12:19,967
How was I supposed to know?

221
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:21,800
You did not tell me.

222
00:12:22,267 --> 00:12:25,800
[WATER GUSHING]

223
00:12:36,267 --> 00:12:38,567
[SLOSHES]

224
00:12:38,700 --> 00:12:42,767
[PLEASANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

225
00:12:46,133 --> 00:12:50,300
[WATER SLOSHING]

226
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:53,900
[SPEAKS IN KOREAN]

227
00:12:56,333 --> 00:12:57,767
Whoo!

228
00:12:57,900 --> 00:13:02,000
[SPEAKING IN KOREAN]

229
00:13:02,133 --> 00:13:06,167
[PLEASANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

230
00:13:12,633 --> 00:13:14,433
Careful.

231
00:13:14,567 --> 00:13:18,467
Wait, should you
even be moving yet?

232
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:22,933
That is what the doctor told me.

233
00:13:23,100 --> 00:13:25,367
This is normal
after an operation.

234
00:13:25,500 --> 00:13:28,000
I need to walk around
so I do not stiffen up.

235
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:32,833
Well, you will probably be
discharged soon.

236
00:13:33,567 --> 00:13:36,433
You know, you are still lucky
you were not seriously hurt.

237
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:40,633
And maybe it would be better
if...

238
00:13:40,767 --> 00:13:42,900
you take a leave
from work for now.

239
00:13:43,033 --> 00:13:44,767
[SENTIMENTAL MUSIC PLAYING]

240
00:13:44,900 --> 00:13:47,933
I missed you being
concerned about me.

241
00:13:49,067 --> 00:13:51,500
Will you take care of me
while I am on leave?

242
00:13:52,933 --> 00:13:54,233
Ah...

243
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:55,867
Wait, Zoey.

244
00:13:57,633 --> 00:13:59,933
I am not sure if...

245
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,933
I can come back right away.

246
00:14:03,067 --> 00:14:04,500
Why?

247
00:14:04,633 --> 00:14:07,067
I need to find Joey.

248
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:11,233
[SENTIMENTAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

249
00:14:11,833 --> 00:14:13,233
[GROANING]

250
00:14:13,367 --> 00:14:14,567
- I will help you.
- Wait a moment.

251
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:16,333
Wait, find her?

252
00:14:17,667 --> 00:14:20,700
Jin Ho took her after our raid.

253
00:14:20,833 --> 00:14:23,000
I just have to make sure
that she is okay.

254
00:14:23,133 --> 00:14:27,233
[SENTIMENTAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

255
00:14:38,633 --> 00:14:40,100
Jin Ho!

256
00:14:40,833 --> 00:14:42,100
Hey!

257
00:14:42,633 --> 00:14:43,700
Joey!

258
00:14:43,833 --> 00:14:44,933
- It's really good!
- Oh my goodness!

259
00:14:45,067 --> 00:14:46,500
- Come here!
- I was looking for you!

260
00:14:46,633 --> 00:14:48,267
What are you doing there?

261
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:54,133
[SPLASHING]

262
00:14:55,533 --> 00:14:57,533
You are like a child!

263
00:15:00,900 --> 00:15:03,833
Jin Ho! Jin Ho!
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

264
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,200
Come here, hurry!

265
00:15:05,333 --> 00:15:07,267
- Why?
- Come here, hurry!

266
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:09,000
- Why?
- Come here!

267
00:15:09,133 --> 00:15:13,333
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

268
00:15:14,667 --> 00:15:16,267
Hurry!

269
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:18,567
- What?
- Oh...

270
00:15:18,700 --> 00:15:20,700
Oh no, no, no...

271
00:15:20,833 --> 00:15:22,767
Turn around, turn around, oh...

272
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:26,767
What happened?

273
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:28,533
Do not move, okay?

274
00:15:28,667 --> 00:15:32,767
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

275
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:38,200
Yuck!

276
00:15:38,333 --> 00:15:39,600
There are so many leeches!

277
00:15:39,733 --> 00:15:40,867
- Lee...
- Leeches!

278
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,733
There are so many leeches
on your back!

279
00:15:42,867 --> 00:15:45,067
- Leeches? Over here?
- Yes!

280
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,733
- Get it off! Get it off!
- Yuck, yuck!

281
00:15:46,867 --> 00:15:48,033
Yuck!

282
00:15:48,733 --> 00:15:50,067
Ah!

283
00:15:50,833 --> 00:15:52,067
There are so many!

284
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,867
-It's because you went swimming!
-Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

285
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,033
Get it off!

286
00:15:55,167 --> 00:15:56,500
Wait, I will get
the first-aid kit.

287
00:15:56,633 --> 00:15:58,100
Stay right there, okay?

288
00:15:58,233 --> 00:15:59,133
- What? Joey, Joey.
- Stay there.

289
00:15:59,267 --> 00:16:00,333
Do not go swimming there again!

290
00:16:00,467 --> 00:16:02,067
- Just wait!
- Don't leave me! Joey!

291
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,700
Oh, this one is yours.

292
00:16:05,500 --> 00:16:07,067
Joey!

293
00:16:08,867 --> 00:16:10,733
Thank you very much, Cruz.

294
00:16:10,867 --> 00:16:12,433
Oh, what did they say?

295
00:16:12,567 --> 00:16:13,400
What did they say?

296
00:16:13,533 --> 00:16:15,233
They got a lead.

297
00:16:15,367 --> 00:16:18,467
They spotted Jin Ho's vehicle
on a toll camera.

298
00:16:19,367 --> 00:16:21,233
Joey was inside the car.
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

299
00:16:21,367 --> 00:16:22,933
Uncle, which toll gate?

300
00:16:23,067 --> 00:16:24,867
At Sta. Monica.

301
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:25,800
- What?
- Sta. Monica?

302
00:16:25,933 --> 00:16:28,433
That exit covers
a very large area.

303
00:16:28,567 --> 00:16:29,933
That is exactly the problem.

304
00:16:30,067 --> 00:16:32,900
Once they exit, there are
no more CCTV cameras there.

305
00:16:33,033 --> 00:16:34,333
But the police there
have already been alerted.

306
00:16:34,467 --> 00:16:35,767
I asked them to check the roads

307
00:16:35,900 --> 00:16:37,700
and nearby establishments.

308
00:16:37,833 --> 00:16:38,733
So that means,

309
00:16:38,867 --> 00:16:41,033
they still do not know
where Joey is?

310
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:43,333
There is somewhere I can go

311
00:16:43,467 --> 00:16:44,767
to ask about Jin Ho.

312
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:46,133
I can try.

313
00:16:46,267 --> 00:16:48,100
Okay, let us use my car instead.

314
00:16:48,233 --> 00:16:49,600
Your pickup
might break down again.

315
00:16:49,733 --> 00:16:51,767
Who said I was taking you
with me?

316
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:55,500
Peter, we need to work together.

317
00:16:55,633 --> 00:16:57,300
Andrew is right.
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

318
00:16:57,433 --> 00:16:59,600
The more people looking
for Joey,

319
00:16:59,733 --> 00:17:01,967
the easier it will be
to find her.

320
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:05,467
What are you waiting for?

321
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:07,667
- Hurry up.
- Let's go.

322
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:08,800
Hurry!

323
00:17:08,933 --> 00:17:10,567
Find Joey!

324
00:17:10,700 --> 00:17:13,967
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

325
00:17:14,100 --> 00:17:16,200
Our child.

326
00:17:22,767 --> 00:17:26,233
Joey! Faster!
[LIGHT PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

327
00:17:28,733 --> 00:17:31,400
-Joey, they're sucking my blood!
-I am coming!

328
00:17:31,533 --> 00:17:33,633
- Wait! You are so dramatic!
- [JIN HO GROANS]

329
00:17:34,433 --> 00:17:36,600
- Just relax, relax!
- I'm dying.

330
00:17:37,467 --> 00:17:38,500
Relax! You are the one
making me panic!

331
00:17:38,633 --> 00:17:41,200
How can I relax?
It is sucking my blood!

332
00:17:41,333 --> 00:17:44,067
[LIGHT PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

333
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,567
[CHUCKLES]

334
00:17:46,867 --> 00:17:48,267
- Wait!
- Please...

335
00:17:48,433 --> 00:17:50,333
- Please save me.
- Ah, wait, wait.

336
00:17:50,467 --> 00:17:51,967
- Take them off.
- I am doing it, I am doing it.

337
00:17:52,100 --> 00:17:53,667
Okay, get it off.

338
00:17:54,533 --> 00:17:55,867
Does it itch?

339
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,733
So, whose fault is that?

340
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:00,200
It's your fault, right?

341
00:18:02,767 --> 00:18:04,233
Let us remove them.

342
00:18:05,033 --> 00:18:06,867
Do not move, okay?

343
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:10,967
[MESMERIZING MUSIC PLAYING]

344
00:18:12,167 --> 00:18:13,933
[GROANING]

345
00:18:14,067 --> 00:18:15,833
Do not move!

346
00:18:17,867 --> 00:18:19,233
There.

347
00:18:19,933 --> 00:18:21,900
Let me take a look.

348
00:18:22,067 --> 00:18:26,033
[MESMERIZING MUSIC CONTINUES]

349
00:18:35,367 --> 00:18:36,633
<i> Jin Ho, are you okay?</i>

350
00:18:36,767 --> 00:18:38,767
<i>You want water?
Do you need to sit down?</i>

351
00:18:38,900 --> 00:18:41,167
<i>Jin Ho! We were worried
about you!</i>

352
00:18:41,300 --> 00:18:42,133
<i> I'm okay.</i>

353
00:18:42,267 --> 00:18:43,667
<i> You're bleeding.</i>

354
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:47,900
[MESMERIZING MUSIC CONTINUES]

355
00:19:09,633 --> 00:19:11,667
Oh, oh, oh, oh!

356
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:13,267
- You are so dramatic.
- Give it to me.

357
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:15,300
- Give it to me.
- Oh.

358
00:19:15,433 --> 00:19:16,767
I am a man.
It is nothing.

359
00:19:16,900 --> 00:19:18,000
- Oh?
- Rude!

360
00:19:18,133 --> 00:19:19,767
Hey!
[GIGGLES]

361
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:21,100
You were the one panicking!

362
00:19:21,233 --> 00:19:23,833
You were so dramatic earlier!
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

363
00:19:23,967 --> 00:19:26,733
- She is sucking my blood.
- Here it is, wait.

364
00:19:26,867 --> 00:19:29,133
Let us treat your bites first.

365
00:19:30,300 --> 00:19:33,600
I saved you now
because you saved me before.

366
00:19:35,433 --> 00:19:36,633
Thank you, Joey.

367
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:40,933
But, we are not even yet.

368
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:43,967
Fine.

369
00:19:44,100 --> 00:19:47,100
You always have a comeback
for everything I say.

370
00:19:47,800 --> 00:19:50,067
Should I put the leeches
back on your back?

371
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,467
Do you want that?

372
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:54,267
Hello? Oh! Oh!

373
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,433
I thought you said
you were a man?

374
00:19:55,567 --> 00:19:57,433
It is nothing.

375
00:19:57,567 --> 00:19:59,000
I am a man.

376
00:19:59,133 --> 00:20:00,200
Here.

377
00:20:00,333 --> 00:20:04,300
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

378
00:20:04,467 --> 00:20:05,267
Ouch.

379
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:07,367
There you go.
This is the last one.

380
00:20:07,500 --> 00:20:11,567
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

381
00:20:12,667 --> 00:20:15,433
There! We are done!

382
00:20:15,567 --> 00:20:17,033
Are you okay?

383
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:19,600
Okay.

384
00:20:20,700 --> 00:20:22,467
Stay here, okay?

385
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:25,033
I will just prepare something
for us to eat.

386
00:20:26,167 --> 00:20:27,700
Follow me later!

387
00:20:27,833 --> 00:20:29,033
That hurts.

388
00:20:29,167 --> 00:20:30,367
Bye.

389
00:20:30,500 --> 00:20:32,033
Thank you, Joey!

390
00:20:32,833 --> 00:20:34,733
You are welcome.

391
00:20:34,900 --> 00:20:36,900
Jin Ho, there is another leech!

392
00:20:37,033 --> 00:20:38,500
Just kidding.

393
00:20:40,167 --> 00:20:41,633
Bye!

394
00:20:41,767 --> 00:20:50,833
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

395
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:54,567
Jin Ho, come on, let's eat!

396
00:20:55,700 --> 00:20:57,333
Jin Ho...

397
00:21:00,533 --> 00:21:01,867
Hello?

398
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:02,867
[MELLOW MUSIC PLAYING]

399
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,767
Jin Ho, come on.

400
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:10,433
- [JIN HO MOANING]
- Jin Ho? Jin Ho...

401
00:21:11,433 --> 00:21:13,433
Are you okay?

402
00:21:13,567 --> 00:21:14,733
Look at me.

403
00:21:14,867 --> 00:21:16,233
Face me.

404
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:18,767
What happened?

405
00:21:18,900 --> 00:21:20,433
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

406
00:21:20,567 --> 00:21:22,833
Hey, you are burning up!

407
00:21:22,967 --> 00:21:23,933
Oh no...

408
00:21:24,067 --> 00:21:25,467
[MURMURS]

409
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:27,467
Wait, wait, wait.

410
00:21:28,500 --> 00:21:29,533
Let me check.

411
00:21:29,667 --> 00:21:31,700
[BREATHING WEAKLY]

412
00:21:31,833 --> 00:21:33,967
Oh no, Jin Ho...

413
00:21:34,100 --> 00:21:36,900
Your wounds are infected!

414
00:21:39,600 --> 00:21:40,367
Just wait, Jin Ho, okay?

415
00:21:40,500 --> 00:21:41,900
I will get some medicine.
Just wait.

416
00:21:42,067 --> 00:21:44,833
[BREATHING WEAKLY]

417
00:21:45,333 --> 00:21:46,467
Joey...

418
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:49,833
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

419
00:21:50,967 --> 00:21:53,033
Poor thing.

420
00:21:53,167 --> 00:21:56,533
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

421
00:22:01,800 --> 00:22:03,300
<i> Do the honors, Jin Ho.</i>

422
00:22:03,433 --> 00:22:04,900
<i> Do it!</i>

423
00:22:06,767 --> 00:22:08,367
Joey...

424
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:10,400
[BREATHING WEAKLY]

425
00:22:10,533 --> 00:22:11,967
Look at me.

426
00:22:12,100 --> 00:22:13,467
Look here.

427
00:22:14,367 --> 00:22:15,900
Take the medicine first.

428
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:19,933
Here.

429
00:22:20,067 --> 00:22:24,200
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

430
00:22:25,433 --> 00:22:26,833
Water.

431
00:22:26,967 --> 00:22:31,100
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

432
00:22:33,933 --> 00:22:36,600
[BREATHING WEAKLY]

433
00:22:36,733 --> 00:22:38,567
Jin Ho...

434
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:42,200
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

435
00:22:43,167 --> 00:22:44,833
About what you said before,

436
00:22:44,967 --> 00:22:45,967
about Jin Ho...

437
00:22:46,100 --> 00:22:46,967
About what?

438
00:22:47,100 --> 00:22:48,500
That he has feelings for Joey.

439
00:22:48,667 --> 00:22:50,567
That is not true.

440
00:22:50,700 --> 00:22:51,900
How can you be sure?
[MELLOW MUSIC PLAYING]

441
00:22:52,033 --> 00:22:53,667
Because we already talked.

442
00:22:53,800 --> 00:22:54,767
We treat each other like
brothers, okay?

443
00:22:54,900 --> 00:22:56,567
- He is my "oppa."
- Oh.

444
00:22:56,700 --> 00:22:58,633
He knows the bro code.

445
00:22:58,767 --> 00:23:00,933
[MELLOW MUSIC PLAYING]

446
00:23:01,067 --> 00:23:04,333
[BREATHING WEAKLY]

447
00:23:06,533 --> 00:23:07,833
There, okay?

448
00:23:07,967 --> 00:23:09,333
I am taking good care of you,

449
00:23:09,467 --> 00:23:12,167
so you should get better soon.

450
00:23:12,700 --> 00:23:14,267
Joey...

451
00:23:15,267 --> 00:23:16,767
Joey...

452
00:23:16,900 --> 00:23:21,167
[MELLOW MUSIC CONTINUES]

453
00:23:22,467 --> 00:23:23,733
Just wait, okay?

454
00:23:25,133 --> 00:23:27,200
All right, get some rest now,
okay?

455
00:23:27,333 --> 00:23:28,767
Joey...

456
00:23:29,900 --> 00:23:31,200
Joey...

457
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:32,900
Joey...

458
00:23:34,367 --> 00:23:35,833
Jin Ho...

459
00:23:38,233 --> 00:23:42,300
[UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING]

460
00:23:44,933 --> 00:23:47,200
This is the friend of Jin Ho
I was telling you about.

461
00:23:47,333 --> 00:23:49,300
We already ordered a search
for Jin Ho's friend.

462
00:23:49,433 --> 00:23:51,333
I think, Berdugo,
they were already warned.

463
00:23:51,467 --> 00:23:53,400
If Jin Ho talks

464
00:23:53,533 --> 00:23:54,833
and points to me,

465
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:56,567
I will cut your head off!

466
00:23:56,700 --> 00:23:57,700
He knows the bro code.

467
00:23:57,833 --> 00:23:58,700
He will not make a move on Joey

468
00:23:58,833 --> 00:24:00,633
because he knows I like her.

469
00:24:00,767 --> 00:24:02,300
I did not expect to feel

470
00:24:02,433 --> 00:24:04,067
this strongly about Joey.

471
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:05,300
Are you also in love with Joey?

472
00:24:05,433 --> 00:24:06,867
Peter, we need to find Joey

473
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:08,300
before it is too late.

474
00:24:08,433 --> 00:24:09,900
It is peaceful here, right?

475
00:24:10,033 --> 00:24:11,967
I feel like I do not want
to leave this place anymore.
